1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,390
Salama, sawi! Ca tu ka tene kiwawo sinu?
Hello, friend! Do you have fresh fruit?

2
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:09,080
Ka! Cu kiwawo pu ta ka sinu, sa to ka pemu. Cu ku sile!
Yes! My fruit is fresh and sweet. Take a look!

3
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,610
Peya pu kiwawo soluni ka sama co?
What is the price of the yellow fruit?

4
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:14,220
Peya ka sama kin pa kiwawo ken.
It's two for one fruit.

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,870
Ta ka cana kiwawo san. Ca tu ki tona tiyu tuye?
I want five. Could you give me some bread too?

6
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:22,720
Ka. Cu peya pu sewa ka sama ken kin. Cu tane, sawi!
Sure. The price of everything is twelve. Thank you, friend!

7
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:25,890
Tane! Cu tu ku tene solu poni!
Thanks! Have a good day!

